Recognize Guix installations without making the user's entire configuration
read-only.  Only keys in HERMES_MANAGED_DIR are declarative; program updates
belong to Guix and must not invoke the self-updater in the store.

Upstream: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
Status: local Guix integration, covered by hermes-guix-test.py

